Yes, <b>there is</b>.

00:00:43.836 --> 00:00:45.805
<b>Are there any</b> pictures?

00:00:47.877 --> 00:00:49.691
Yes, <b>there are</b>.

00:00:52.593 --> 00:00:53.836
<b>Is there</b> a bath?

